## PR Title
Support vpiSigned (#6868)

## PR Description
Closes issue #6868: implements the `vpiSigned` property on `vpiReg` and `vpiNet` objects so that callers can query whether a Verilog signal is signed via `vpi_get(vpiSigned, handle)`.

